## How to Add Yourself

If you've made significant contributions to Nexivora and would like to be listed as an author:

1. Make sure you have at least 5 non-trivial contributions
2. Open a pull request adding yourself to this file
3. Follow the existing format
4. Keep the list in alphabetical order by first name

## Contribution Types

Contributions that qualify for authorship include:
- Code contributions (features, bug fixes, improvements)
- Documentation (tutorials, guides, API docs)
- Design (UI/UX, graphics, themes)
- Localization (translations)
- Significant bug reports with detailed analysis
- Project infrastructure improvements

## Recognition

All contributors are valued members of the Nexivora community. Whether you're listed here or not, your contributions help make Nexivora better for everyone!

For a complete list of contributors, see:
- [GitHub Contributors](https://github.com/nexivora/nexivora/graphs/contributors)
- [Git Commit History](https://github.com/nexivora/nexivora/commits/main)